sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff / Admin (Shift Worker - S-11)
    actor Admin as Admin (HR Reviewer - A-03 / S-11)
    participant Ctrl as StaffAttendanceController
    participant Val as StaffCheckInValidator / StaffCheckOutValidator
    participant Svc as StaffAttendanceService
    participant Audit as AuditLogService
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext (PostgreSQL)

    Note over Staff, DB: 1. Điểm danh đầu ca (UTC+7), tính chuỗi 7 ngày & tách biệt ví công dân (UC S-11 - BR-GAM-08, BR-GAM-09)
    Staff->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/attendance/check-in { shiftNote } [JWT Staff/Admin]
    Ctrl->>Val: ValidateAsync(request) [ShiftNote <= 500 chars]
    alt ShiftNote > 500 ký tự
        Val-->>Ctrl: IsValid = false
        Ctrl-->>Staff: 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01)
    else Hợp lệ
        Ctrl->>Svc: CheckInAsync(staffUserId, payload, ct)
        Svc->>DB: EnsureStaffProfileExistsAsync(staffUserId) [Auto-init NV-xxx / ADM-xx if missing]
        Svc->>Svc: Compute todayVn = DateOnly.FromDateTime(UtcNow + 07:00)
        Svc->>DB: Check StaffAttendances WHERE StaffId == userId AND WorkDate == todayVn
        alt Đã điểm danh trong ngày hôm nay (BR-GAM-09)
            Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw BusinessRuleException("BR-GAM-09")
            Ctrl-->>Staff: 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01)
        else Chưa điểm danh hôm nay
            Svc->>DB: Query last StaffAttendance WHERE WorkDate < todayVn ORDER BY WorkDate DESC
            alt Có mặt ngày hôm qua (WorkDate == todayVn - 1)
                Svc->>Svc: streakDay = (last.StreakDay % 7) + 1
            else Bỏ lỡ ngày trước đó (Đứt chuỗi)
                Svc->>Svc: streakDay = 1
            end
            Svc->>Svc: pointsEarned = (streakDay == 7 ? 15 : 10)
            Svc->>DB: Insert StaffAttendance (KHÔNG đụng UserEcoProfiles.CurrentGreenPoints - BR-GAM-08)
            Svc->>DB: SaveChangesAsync()
            Svc->>Audit: LogAsync("STAFF_CHECK_IN", "StaffAttendance", attendanceId, newValues={streakDay, pointsEarned})
            Svc-->>Ctrl: StaffAttendanceStatusDto
            Ctrl-->>Staff: 201 Created ApiResponse<StaffAttendanceStatusDto> (MSG-GEN-01)
        end
    end

    Note over Staff, DB: 2. Kết thúc ca trực & ghi nhận số lượng tác vụ vận hành trong ca
    Staff->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/attendance/check-out { shiftNote }
    Ctrl->>Svc: CheckOutAsync(staffUserId, payload, ct)
    Svc->>DB: Find today StaffAttendance
    alt Chưa Check-in hoặc đã Check-out trước đó
        Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw BusinessRuleException("BR-GAM-09")
        Ctrl-->>Staff: 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01)
    else Hợp lệ
        Svc->>DB: Count AuditLogs WHERE ActorUserId == staffUserId AND CreatedAt BETWEEN CheckInAt..Now
        Svc->>DB: Update CheckOutAt = UtcNow, WorkedMinutes, TasksCompletedSnapshot, ShiftNote
        Svc->>DB: SaveChangesAsync()
        Svc->>Audit: LogAsync("STAFF_CHECK_OUT", "StaffAttendance", attendanceId, newValues={workedMinutes, tasksCompleted})
        Svc-->>Ctrl: StaffAttendanceStatusDto
        Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK ApiResponse<StaffAttendanceStatusDto> (MSG-GEN-01)
    end

    Note over Staff, Admin: 3. Nhân viên tự tra cứu bảng tháng & Admin giám sát chuyên cần đội ngũ
    Staff->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/staff/attendance/me?month=11&year=2026
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetMyAttendanceAsync(staffUserId, month, year, ct)
    Svc->>DB: Aggregate StaffAttendances & monthly AuditLogs count
    Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK ApiResponse<StaffAttendanceStatusDto>

    Admin->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/staff/attendance?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20 [JWT Admin]
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetAllStaffAttendanceAsync(filter, ct)
    Svc->>DB: Query StaffAttendances Include(StaffProfile, User)
    Ctrl-->>Admin: 200 OK ApiResponse<PagedResult<AdminStaffAttendanceItemDto>>
